        <mxCell id="n0" value="New contract: JSON protocol 2, proposed 10Hz records; drivers default OFF.&#10;S06 CSV D/H protocol and 20Hz IMU + 1Hz status remain source proposals.&#10;Legacy 50-100Hz IMU targets are not implemented or field-verified.&#10;Original running sketch / format has not been recovered.&#10;Raw MPU-6050 data does not provide validated absolute heading.&#10;No RC commands, motion watchdog, GPS, sorting or autonomous navigation.&#10;Optional camera capture is separate; no synchronization accuracy claim." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
